#: ../../deploy/release/README.md:2
msgid "Releases"
msgstr "发布"

#: ../../deploy/release/README.md:4
msgid ""
"A Cloud Agent release is two files. `release.json`, the manifest, names "
"one source commit, every owned image by registry digest with its "
"platforms, the sandbox runtime catalog, the database revision, the "
"deployment protocol and the recorded compatibility checks. "
"`recipe.tar.gz` holds the scripts and Compose templates that install "
"those images without a source checkout. A downstream distribution pins "
"the SHA-256 of the manifest's exact bytes in its own reviewed lock; the "
"manifest pins the recipe and images."
msgstr ""
"一个 Cloud Agent 发布包含两个文件。清单 `release.json` 列出一个源码提交、每个自有镜像的仓库 digest "
"及其平台、沙箱运行时目录、数据库版本、部署协议和已记录的兼容性检查。`recipe.tar.gz` 包含无需源码仓库副本就能安装这些镜像的脚本和 "
"Compose 模板。下游发行版在自己经过审查的锁文件中固定清单原始字节的 SHA-256；清单再固定配方和镜像。"

