#: ../../deploy/release/README.md:28
msgid ""
"A change visible in the manifest (role, variant, base path, platform or "
"cell count) changes `manifest_contract.artifact_shape_sha256`. Review its"
" compatibility and schema impact, then accept it with `--write --accept-"
"contract-change`; plain `--write` refuses. A new catalog cell still needs"
" a Dockerfile, a real case in `smoke.py`, deployment integration, and a "
"contract fixture when compatibility changes."
msgstr ""
"清单中可见的变化（角色、变体、基础路径、平台或单元数量）会改变 "
"`manifest_contract.artifact_shape_sha256`。先评审它对兼容性和 schema 的影响，再用 "
"`--write --accept-contract-change` 接受；单独的 `--write` 会拒绝。新的目录单元仍然需要 "
"Dockerfile、`smoke.py` 中真实的测试用例、部署集成，以及兼容性变化时的契约测试夹具。"

