#: ../../deploy/release/README.md:48
msgid ""
"The `agents` web variant (base path `/agents`) is no longer built, but "
"the schema still accepts it in v1 manifests "
"(`manifest_contract.retired_web_variants`) so that a rollback validates. "
"New manifests name the source repository `HarvardMadSys/cloud-agent`, and"
" the generator accepts a `publisher_run_url` only under that name. "
"Releases published before 2026-11-10 carry the former name, "
"`HarvardMadSys/hybridInference-cloud-agent`, in `source_repository`, "
"`publisher_run_url` and the recipe URL; the schema accepts exactly these "
"two names."
msgstr ""
"`agents` Web 变体（基础路径 `/agents`）已不再构建，但 schema 在 v1 "
"清单中仍接受它（`manifest_contract.retired_web_variants`），以便回滚时能通过校验。新清单把源码仓库写为 "
"`HarvardMadSys/cloud-agent`，生成器只接受该名称下的 `publisher_run_url`。2026-11-10 "
"之前发布的版本在 `source_repository`、`publisher_run_url` 和配方 URL 中带的是旧名称 "
"`HarvardMadSys/hybridInference-cloud-agent`；schema 恰好接受这两个名称。"

#: ../../deploy/release/README.md:57
msgid ""
"Image references must be digests under this organization's registry. The "
"schema enforces role and web-variant cardinality, and the generator "
"validates its output against the schema before writing it. It also checks"
" that each runtime's `default` appears in its `versions`, which JSON "
"Schema cannot express, so consumers must check that themselves. "
"`deploy_protocol` comes from `deploy/DEPLOY_PROTOCOL`, "
"`database_revision` from Alembic's script directory, and "
"`runtime_catalog` from the sandbox image's labels."
msgstr ""
"镜像引用必须是本组织仓库下的 digest。schema 强制角色和 Web 变体的数量，生成器在写出之前会用 schema "
"校验自己的输出。它还检查每个运行时的 `default` 是否出现在其 `versions` 中，这一点 JSON Schema "
"无法表达，所以使用方必须自行检查。`deploy_protocol` 来自 "
"`deploy/DEPLOY_PROTOCOL`，`database_revision` 来自 Alembic "
"的脚本目录，`runtime_catalog` 来自沙箱镜像的标签。"

#: ../../deploy/release/README.md:65
msgid ""
"The generator does not query the registry. A downstream resolver must "
"verify that each digest exists, has the declared platforms, and carries "
"the expected `org.opencontainers.image.revision` and "
"`io.hybridinference.artifact.role` labels on each platform image."
msgstr ""
"生成器不查询镜像仓库。下游解析器必须核实每个 digest 存在、具备声明的平台，并且每个平台镜像都带有预期的 "
"`org.opencontainers.image.revision` 和 `io.hybridinference.artifact.role` "
"标签。"

#: ../../deploy/release/README.md:70
msgid "Producing one"
msgstr "生成发布"

#: ../../deploy/release/README.md:72
msgid ""
"[The publication workflow](../../.github/workflows/publish.yml) runs on "
"pushes to `dev`, on successful CI, and by manual dispatch for a `dev` "
"commit with successful CI. A push builds alongside CI, but publishes only"
" after the newest push CI run on that commit succeeds. The workflow:"
msgstr ""
"[发布工作流](../../.github/workflows/publish.yml)在推送到 `dev`、CI 成功完成时运行，也可以对 CI"
" 已成功的 `dev` 提交手动触发。推送触发的构建与 CI 并行，但只有该提交最新一次推送触发的 CI 成功后才会发布。工作流的步骤："

#: ../../deploy/release/README.md:77
msgid ""
"Checks that the commit is on `dev`, and leaves an existing release "
"unchanged."
msgstr "确认提交在 `dev` 上，并且不改动已存在的发布。"

#: ../../deploy/release/README.md:79
msgid ""
"Builds and pushes each artifact by digest with `SOURCE_COMMIT` set to the"
" full commit SHA, pulls the digest back, smoke-tests it, and records its "
"digest, platform and labels."
msgstr ""
"以完整提交 SHA 作为 `SOURCE_COMMIT`，按 digest 构建并推送每个产物，再拉回该 digest 做冒烟测试，记录其 "
"digest、平台和标签。"

#: ../../deploy/release/README.md:82
msgid ""
"Assembles the five cell records, builds the recipe and writes the "
"manifest."
msgstr "汇总五个单元的记录，构建配方并写出清单。"

#: ../../deploy/release/README.md:83
msgid "Runs control-plane integration acceptance on those exact files."
msgstr "对这些文件运行控制平面集成验收。"

#: ../../deploy/release/README.md:84
msgid ""
"Creates a draft release tagged `agent-<full-sha>`, uploads both files and"
" makes it visible; a failed upload deletes the draft."
msgstr "创建标签为 `agent-<full-sha>` 的草稿发布，上传两个文件后将其公开；上传失败会删除草稿。"

#: ../../deploy/release/README.md:87
msgid ""
"Failed or cancelled CI leaves built images in the registry without a "
"manifest. The workflow has no pull-request trigger, and it publishes "
"artifacts without deploying any environment."
msgstr "CI 失败或取消时，已构建的镜像会留在镜像仓库中，但没有清单。该工作流没有拉取请求触发器，它只发布产物，不部署任何环境。"

#: ../../deploy/release/README.md:91
msgid ""
"To generate by hand from the repository root, put the five cell JSON "
"files in `cells/`, and set `SOURCE_COMMIT` to their full 40-character SHA"
" and `PUBLISHER_RUN_URL` to the publisher's Actions run URL:"
msgstr ""
"要在仓库根目录手动生成，把五个单元的 JSON 文件放进 `cells/`，并把 `SOURCE_COMMIT` 设为它们完整的 40 位 "
"SHA，把 `PUBLISHER_RUN_URL` 设为发布者的 Actions 运行 URL："

#: ../../deploy/release/README.md:112
msgid ""
"`inputs.json` holds `source_commit`, `artifacts` and `runtime_labels`, "
"the sandbox's label map from `docker image inspect` (what the host reads "
"when stamping attempts). The manifest is written atomically, after every "
"check passes."
msgstr ""
"`inputs.json` 包含 `source_commit`、`artifacts` 和 `runtime_labels`，后者是 "
"`docker image inspect` 给出的沙箱标签表（主机给 attempt "
"打标记时读取的就是它）。所有检查通过后，清单才会以原子方式写出。"

