#: ../../deploy/release/README.md:131
msgid ""
"The tests also check `org.opencontainers.image.revision`, "
"`io.hybridinference.artifact.role` and the web image's "
"`io.hybridinference.artifact.base_path`. Dockerfiles default the revision"
" to `unknown`, so publication must supply the commit. None of this proves"
" that a job runs or that Kata works on a host."
msgstr ""
"测试还检查 "
"`org.opencontainers.image.revision`、`io.hybridinference.artifact.role` 以及"
" Web 镜像的 `io.hybridinference.artifact.base_path`。Dockerfile 默认把版本设为 "
"`unknown`，所以发布时必须提供提交。这些都不能证明任务能运行，也不能证明 Kata 在主机上可用。"

#: ../../deploy/release/README.md:137
msgid "Control-plane integration acceptance"
msgstr "控制平面集成验收"

#: ../../deploy/release/README.md:139
msgid ""
"[acceptance.py](acceptance.py) installs the candidate from an extracted "
"recipe, in a directory with no application source or Dockerfiles. It runs"
" the real control-plane deployer in artifact mode, pulls the candidate "
"digests, and compares the running containers with the manifest through "
"[accept_artifacts.py](accept_artifacts.py), by registry `RepoDigests` and"
" role labels."
msgstr ""
"[acceptance.py](acceptance.py) 在一个没有应用源码和 Dockerfile "
"的目录中，从解压出的配方安装候选版本。它以产物模式运行真实的控制平面部署器，拉取候选 digest，并通过 "
"[accept_artifacts.py](accept_artifacts.py) 按镜像仓库的 `RepoDigests` "
"和角色标签，把运行中的容器与清单比对。"

