#: ../../deploy/release/README.md:154
msgid ""
"There is no execution host, so the exact-commit host readiness fence is "
"expected to time out; the test asserts that the deploy reached it after "
"every earlier stage passed. Because the deployer starts `web` only after "
"the fence, acceptance then starts it with the generated Compose file and "
"`--no-build --pull never`. The workflow publishes the same bytes that "
"passed."
msgstr ""
"验收中没有执行主机，所以精确提交的主机就绪栅栏预期会超时；测试断言部署在之前每个阶段都通过后到达了这里。由于部署器只在栅栏之后启动 "
"`web`，验收随后用生成的 Compose 文件和 `--no-build --pull never` "
"启动它。工作流发布的正是通过验收的那些字节。"

#: ../../deploy/release/README.md:160
msgid "Registry layout"
msgstr "镜像仓库布局"

#: ../../deploy/release/README.md:162
msgid ""
"Deployments select images by the manifest's digests and read each image's"
