#: ../../deploy/release/README.md:170
msgid ""
"After its smoke test passes, each digest is also tagged, for example "
"`control-<sha>`, `web-root-<sha>` or `sandbox-<sha>`, to help people "
"inspect images. Tags such as `buildcache-sandbox-2026-w42` are the "
"publication workflow's layer cache, a new one each ISO week; unchanged "
"layers keep their digests, so a host on the previous release pulls only "
"what changed. When moving images between registries, check that the copy "
"keeps the original index digest: a recreated or converted index has a new"
" digest and needs a reviewed lock update. Keep old addresses until the "
"rollback window closes."
msgstr ""
"冒烟测试通过后，每个 digest 还会打上标签，例如 `control-<sha>`、`web-root-<sha>` 或 "
"`sandbox-<sha>`，方便人工查看镜像。`buildcache-sandbox-2026-w42` 这类标签是发布工作流的层缓存，每个 "
"ISO 周新建一个；未变化的层保持原 digest，所以运行上一版本的主机只拉取变化的部分。在镜像仓库之间搬迁镜像时，要确认副本保留了原来的 "
"index digest：重新创建或转换格式的 index 会得到新 digest，需要经审查的锁文件更新。在回滚窗口结束前保留旧地址。"

#: ../../deploy/release/README.md:179
msgid "Deployment protocol"
msgstr "部署协议"

#: ../../deploy/release/README.md:181
msgid ""
"The protocol is `shared-live-exact-sha-v4` (`deploy/DEPLOY_PROTOCOL`). v4"
" introduced the [single sandbox "
"network](../../docs/agents/specs/2026-09-23-agent-public-egress-design"
".zh-CN.md), removed the Squid `egress` artifact, and requires "
"`AGENT_EGRESS_CHAT_NETWORK_POOL` and `AGENT_EGRESS_DNS_SERVER` on every "
"runner host. A v3 deployer cannot install a v4 release, and rollback does"
" not cross the boundary. Runtime labels keep the "
"`org.freeinference.runtime.*` namespace; renaming them needs a separate "
"dual-read migration."
msgstr ""
"协议为 `shared-live-exact-sha-v4`（`deploy/DEPLOY_PROTOCOL`）。v4 "
"引入了[单一沙箱网络](../../docs/agents/specs/2026-09-23-agent-public-egress-design"
".zh-CN.md)，移除了 Squid `egress` 产物，并要求每台 runner 主机设置 "
"`AGENT_EGRESS_CHAT_NETWORK_POOL` 和 `AGENT_EGRESS_DNS_SERVER`。v3 的部署器不能安装 "
"v4 发布，回滚也不能跨越这个边界。运行时标签沿用 `org.freeinference.runtime.*` "
"命名空间；重命名需要单独做一次双读迁移。"

#: ../../deploy/release/README.md:190
msgid "Deploying a recipe"
msgstr "部署 recipe"

#: ../../deploy/release/README.md:192
msgid ""
"Before replacing services, verify the manifest against the downstream "
"lock, the recipe's SHA-256 against the manifest, and the image digests. "
"Extracting `recipe.tar.gz` creates a `recipe/` directory of deployment "
"helpers, examples and Compose templates without `build:` entries."
msgstr ""
"替换服务之前，先用下游锁文件核对清单，用清单核对配方的 SHA-256，并核实镜像 digest。解压 `recipe.tar.gz` 会得到一个"
" `recipe/` 目录，其中有部署辅助脚本、示例和不含 `build:` 条目的 Compose 模板。"

#: ../../deploy/release/README.md:197
msgid ""
"Both machines need Bash, Docker with Compose v2, and Python 3.12 or "
"newer. The execution host also needs its Kata provisioning; deployment "
"installs no sandbox runtime. Install the helper dependencies on each "
"machine:"
msgstr ""
"两台机器都需要 Bash、带 Compose v2 的 Docker，以及 Python 3.12 或更新版本。执行主机还需要事先完成 Kata "
"配置；部署不会安装沙箱运行时。在每台机器上安装辅助脚本的依赖："

#: ../../deploy/release/README.md:207
msgid ""
"Keep `DEPLOY_ROOT` the same across releases: its optional `.env`, "
"`.deployed-sha` and `.shared-live-ready` describe the deployment, while "
"each recipe can be extracted anywhere. A new control plane needs no "
"`.env`; its first `prepare` phase starts the `keys` service, which "
"generates its keys ([new installation](../../docs/developer/operations.md"
"#admin-settings)). A host's `.env` is the one server setup writes; a "
"downstream deployer that manages hosts itself writes the same variables "
"([host configuration](../../docs/developer/operations.md#host-"
"configuration-reference)). An existing installation keeps its "
"configuration, Compose project name, host enrollment root and Docker data"
" root. Generated Compose files stay under `DEPLOY_ROOT`, so relative "
"mounts keep their data paths. `AGENT_WEB_VARIANT` may be omitted or "
"`root`; an `AGENT_WEB_BASE_PATH` with a value is refused."
msgstr ""
"各版本之间保持 `DEPLOY_ROOT` 不变：其中可选的 `.env`、`.deployed-sha` 和 `.shared-live-"
"ready` 描述这个部署，而每个配方可以解压到任何地方。新的控制平面不需要 `.env`；它的第一个 `prepare` 阶段会启动 "
"`keys` 服务来生成密钥（[新安装](../../docs/developer/operations.md#admin-"
"settings)）。主机的 `.env` "
"由服务器设置写入；自己管理主机的下游部署器写入相同的变量（[主机配置](../../docs/developer/operations.md"
"#host-configuration-reference)）。已有安装保留其配置、Compose 项目名、主机注册根目录和 Docker "
"数据根目录。生成的 Compose 文件留在 `DEPLOY_ROOT` "
"下，因此相对挂载保持原来的数据路径。`AGENT_WEB_VARIANT` 可以省略或设为 `root`；设置了值的 "
"`AGENT_WEB_BASE_PATH` 会被拒绝。"

#: ../../deploy/release/README.md:221
msgid ""
"Set the artifact environment on the control-plane machine, and the same "
"on the execution host with its own root (`DEPLOY_ROOT=/srv/cloud-agent-"
"host`). Use absolute paths: `deploy.sh` changes into `DEPLOY_ROOT` before"
" it reads `AGENT_RELEASE_MANIFEST`."
msgstr ""
"在控制平面机器上设置产物模式的环境变量，执行主机上设置相同的变量，但使用它自己的根目录（`DEPLOY_ROOT=/srv/cloud-"
"agent-host`）。请使用绝对路径：`deploy.sh` 会先切换到 `DEPLOY_ROOT`，再读取 "
"`AGENT_RELEASE_MANIFEST`。"

#: ../../deploy/release/README.md:233
msgid ""
"The manifest supplies the commit and image references, so remove old "
"image and commit overrides; a conflicting effective Compose value is "
"refused before anything is pulled. The default `source` mode still "
"deploys from a checkout."
msgstr ""
"清单提供提交和镜像引用，所以请删掉旧的镜像和提交覆盖项；有冲突的 Compose 实际取值会在拉取任何内容之前被拒绝。默认的 `source` "
"模式仍从仓库副本部署。"

#: ../../deploy/release/README.md:237
msgid "Rolling out both machines"
msgstr "依次部署两台机器"

#: ../../deploy/release/README.md:239
msgid ""
"Run the phases in this order, with the environment above set on each "
"machine:"
msgstr "在每台机器上设置好上面的环境变量后，按以下顺序运行各阶段："

#: ../../deploy/release/README.md:241
msgid ""
"Prepare both sides. They may run in parallel and replace no serving "
"service."
msgstr "准备两边。它们可以并行运行，不会替换任何正在服务的组件。"

#: ../../deploy/release/README.md:251
msgid ""
"Prepare the database on the control-plane machine. This migrates and "
"checks the identity namespace; on a cold machine it also starts the API "
"and MCP listener that the host readiness probes need."
msgstr "在控制平面机器上准备数据库。这一步执行迁移并检查身份命名空间；在冷启动的机器上，它还会启动主机就绪探测需要的 API 和 MCP 监听器。"

#: ../../deploy/release/README.md:259
msgid ""
"Activate the execution host. It drains and replaces runners, checks the "
"replacement, records the deployment and publishes its generation."
msgstr "激活执行主机。它排空并替换 runner，检查替换结果，记录部署并发布其 generation。"

#: ../../deploy/release/README.md:266
msgid ""
"Activate the control plane. The readiness fence must pass before public "
"services switch."
msgstr "激活控制平面：必须先通过就绪栅栏，对外的服务才会切换过去。"

#: ../../deploy/release/README.md:273
msgid ""
"Without `--phase`, a script runs all its phases, which cannot express "
"this cross-machine order. Phases can be retried: database preparation "
"keeps track of the listeners it started, and activation restarts any a "
"failed attempt stopped so they can accept the heartbeat the fence needs. "
"If the other machine fails and you abandon the rollout, remove the "
"listeners started only for this cold deployment; serving listeners are "
"left alone:"
msgstr ""
"不带 `--phase` "
"时，脚本会运行它的所有阶段，这样无法表达跨机器的顺序。各阶段可以重试：数据库准备会记住它启动过的监听器，激活会重新启动上次失败尝试停掉的监听器，让它们能接收栅栏需要的心跳。如果另一台机器失败而你放弃了这次部署，请删除仅为这次冷部署启动的监听器；正在服务的监听器不受影响："

#: ../../deploy/release/README.md:284
msgid ""
"Image pulls and host Kata checks run before runners drain. A failed "
"readiness check keeps the replacement control-plane stack from "
"activating. The script tests run extracted recipes with Docker calls "
"recorded and failures injected; they do not prove a particular host, live"
" Kata runtime or registry release, so verify those when cutting over an "
"environment."
msgstr ""
"镜像拉取和主机 Kata 检查在排空 runner 之前进行。就绪检查失败时，替换用的控制平面不会被激活。脚本测试会运行解压出的配方，记录 "
"Docker 调用并注入故障；它们不能证明某台具体主机、实际运行的 Kata 或镜像仓库中的发布是否可用，所以切换环境时要核实这些。"

#: ../../deploy/release/README.md:290
msgid "What a downstream deployment still owns"
msgstr "下游部署仍要自己负责的事"

#: ../../deploy/release/README.md:292
msgid ""
"This repository publishes artifacts and deploys nothing. A consuming "
"distribution must:"
msgstr "本仓库只发布产物，不部署任何东西。使用它的发行版必须："

#: ../../deploy/release/README.md:295
msgid ""
"pin the exact manifest bytes in a reviewed lock and verify the schema, "
"recipe hash, registry digests, image labels and platforms;"
msgstr "在经过审查的锁文件中固定清单的原始字节，并核实 schema、配方哈希、镜像仓库 digest、镜像标签和平台；"

#: ../../deploy/release/README.md:297
msgid ""
"check protocol compatibility and the manifest's `verified_upgrade_from` "
"and `verified_rollback_to` records, where an empty list means the path "
"was not verified;"
msgstr ""
"检查协议兼容性以及清单中的 `verified_upgrade_from` 和 `verified_rollback_to` "
"记录，空列表表示该路径未经验证；"

#: ../../deploy/release/README.md:300
msgid "run preparation, Kata checks and environment acceptance on its own hosts;"
msgstr "在自己的主机上运行准备、Kata 检查和环境验收；"

#: ../../deploy/release/README.md:301
msgid ""
"keep environment configuration, deployment records and recovery material "
"outside this repository."
msgstr "把环境配置、部署记录和恢复材料保存在本仓库之外。"

#: ../../deploy/release/README.md:304
msgid ""
"Keep previous verified manifests, recipes, hashes and digest-addressed "
"images apart from the deployment roots. An artifact-mode host rollout "
"receives one manifest and cannot select an older release by itself, and a"
" previous release is not automatically compatible with newer migrations. "
"To roll back, follow [recover a previous artifact "
"release](../../docs/developer/disaster-recovery.md#recover-a-previous-"
"artifact-release)."
msgstr ""
"把之前验证过的清单、配方、哈希和按 digest "
"寻址的镜像与部署根目录分开保存。产物模式下的主机部署只接收一个清单，不能自行选择更早的发布；而且之前的发布并不自动兼容较新的迁移。要回滚，请按照[恢复之前的产物发布](../../docs/developer"
"/disaster-recovery.md#recover-a-previous-artifact-release)操作。"

